WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.829
Some days are easier to say than to write.

2
00:00:05.129 --> 00:00:08.184
So Tell Anew lets you just talk to your camera.

3
00:00:09.484 --> 00:00:13.380
When you're done, it writes down every word, right on your phone.

4
00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:18.517
It gives each entry a title, so it's easy to find later.

5
00:00:19.817 --> 00:00:23.802
Months from now, search one word, and the day comes back.

6
00:00:25.102 --> 00:00:31.823
Nothing goes to us. No account. Backup only to your own iCloud, if you turn it on.

7
00:00:33.123 --> 00:00:37.078
Tell Anew. Your life, in your own voice.
